@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Notice";
}

<div class="page-head">
    <div>
        <div class="page-title">Privacy Notice</div>
        <div class="page-desc">How SmartJob stores and protects information, in line with POPIA (the Protection of Personal Information Act).</div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card" style="max-width:800px;background:var(--accent-bg);border:1px solid var(--accent);padding:16px 20px;margin-bottom:20px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;">
    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent-deep)" stroke-width="2" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:2px;"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" /><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12" /><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16" /></svg>
    <div style="color:var(--accent-deep);font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;">
        <strong>Job records, photographs, and signatures are retained indefinitely</strong> — not deleted after a job closes — so they remain available for warranty claims, equipment renewals, and maintenance history.
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card section-card" style="max-width:800px;border-left:4px solid var(--accent);">
    <div class="section-card-head" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;gap:10px;">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.8"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="17" rx="2" /><line x1="8" y1="9" x2="16" y2="9" /><line x1="8" y1="13" x2="16" y2="13" /></svg>
        <h3 style="margin:0;">What we store</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="section-card-body pad">
        <p>SmartJob stores information needed to schedule, complete, and keep a record of field service work, including:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Names, email addresses, and phone numbers of Verteco staff and technicians</li>
            <li>Customer and site contact details and addresses</li>
            <li>Equipment details and serial numbers</li>
            <li>Photographs taken as evidence of completed work</li>
            <li>Technician and customer signatures captured on job completion</li>
            <li>Job notes, checklist responses, and corrective action records</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card section-card" style="max-width:800px;border-left:4px solid var(--accent);margin-top:16px;">
    <div class="section-card-head" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;gap:10px;">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" /><path d="M12 7v5l3 3" /></svg>
        <h3 style="margin:0;">Why we store it</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="section-card-body pad">
        <p>This information is collected to carry out and verify installation and maintenance work, and to keep an accurate record for future reference. Records are kept beyond the duration of the original job since they may be needed later for warranty claims, equipment renewals, or maintenance history.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card section-card" style="max-width:800px;border-left:4px solid var(--accent);margin-top:16px;">
    <div class="section-card-head" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;gap:10px;">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 5-3.5 8.5-7 10-3.5-1.5-7-5-7-10V6l7-3Z" /></svg>
        <h3 style="margin:0;">How it is protected</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="section-card-body pad">
        <ul>
            <li>All traffic between your browser, the mobile app, and our servers is encrypted (HTTPS)</li>
            <li>Passwords are never stored in plain text — they are hashed using an industry-standard algorithm</li>
            <li>Access is role-based: a Manager can see jobs across the business, while a Technician can only see and act on jobs assigned to them</li>
            <li>Repeated failed login attempts temporarily lock an account to prevent password-guessing</li>
            <li>Every significant action — job creation, assignment, approval, and account changes — is recorded in an audit trail showing who did what and when</li>
            <li>Photographs and documents are stored in a private cloud storage container, not publicly accessible</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="card section-card" style="max-width:800px;border-left:4px solid var(--accent);margin-top:16px;">
    <div class="section-card-head" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;gap:10px;">
        <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z" /></svg>
        <h3 style="margin:0;">Your data, your questions</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="section-card-body pad">
        <p>If you have questions about what information SmartJob holds about you, or why, please speak to your manager or system administrator.</p>
    </div>
</div>